{"blocks": [{"type": "paragraph", "text": "海邉朱莉です"}, {"type": "break"}, {"type": "paragraph", "text": "今日のオンラインミート＆グリートありがとうございました！"}, {"type": "break"}, {"type": "paragraph", "text": "お話できてすごく楽しかったです"}, {"type": "paragraph", "text": "素敵な言葉たくさんかけてもらって元気もらいました！"}, {"type": "break"}, {"type": "paragraph", "text": "本当にありがとう＾＾"}, {"type": "break"}, {"type": "paragraph", "text": "現在発売中の「アップトゥボーイ Vol.367」さんに掲載していただいています！"}, {"type": "break"}, {"type": "paragraph", "text": "ガーリーな雰囲気で、ふわふわのかわいい衣装を身にまとってあたたかい雰囲気のなかで撮っていただきました"}, {"type": "break"}, {"type": "paragraph", "text": "なんかお姫様みたいってとてもわくわくしてました＾＾"}, {"type": "break"}, {"type": "paragraph", "text": "手にとっていただけると嬉しいです〜"}, {"type": "break"}, {"type": "paragraph", "text": "オフショット＾＾"}, {"type": "image", "src": "https://www.nogizaka46.com/files/46/diary/n46/MEMBER/moblog/202609/moblgkEnb.jpg", "alt": ""}, {"type": "image", "src": "https://www.nogizaka46.com/files/46/diary/n46/MEMBER/moblog/202609/mobx4Jits.jpg", "alt": ""}, {"type": "image", "src": "https://www.nogizaka46.com/files/46/diary/n46/MEMBER/moblog/202609/mobYsFnPn.jpg", "alt": ""}, {"type": "image", "src": "https://www.nogizaka46.com/files/46/diary/n46/MEMBER/moblog/202609/mob4GYyee.jpg", "alt": ""}, {"type": "image", "src": "https://www.nogizaka46.com/files/46/diary/n46/MEMBER/moblog/202609/mobepxTiS.jpg", "alt": ""}, {"type": "paragraph", "text": "ミーグリ終わりでにこにこだから＾＾の顔文字たくさんつかっちゃう"}, {"type": "break"}, {"type": "paragraph", "text": "＾＾"}, {"type": "break"}, {"type": "paragraph", "text": "＾＾"}, {"type": "break"}, {"type": "paragraph", "text": "＾＾"}, {"type": "break"}, {"type": "paragraph", "text": "なんか一気に寒くなったね"}, {"type": "break"}, {"type": "paragraph", "text": "無理せず、かぜひかないでね"}, {"type": "break"}, {"type": "paragraph", "text": "海邉朱莉"}], "source": "official"}